        "TileImage": "$($repository 0fee1154-c66b-41e1-b504-897374cfdaff).Image",
        "Description": "Madam Carlisle has become disatisfied with her heirs and decided to clean house.  Having started with her brother she has hired you, ostensibly a private investigator solving the murder, to assassinate the remaining members of her immediate family.  All targets should be easily accessible, but quite public.  Good luck, 47. I will leave you to prepare.",
